# Raft Row Bazaar - the second island of the library's plan The City That Never Sank (SL13, Highwater, chapter 2)
# Highwater's black market: a raft of Raft's own foundations lashed between four drowned towers' roofs off a small green
# key, stalls under wooden roofs, string lights, flags, a vending machine on the key. The key is the market's garden:
# hens and goats, flowers in five colours, pineapples, watermelons, strawberries and beet planters. Quest "Prices
# Without Rules" (24 steps): the market, the price board, the engine stall's plans (motor wheel), the shortage list,
# the Free Fleet's stall, the steering wheel's plans, the merchant's back room (key from his drawer), the withheld
# stock ledger, a hen for the Fleet's coop, the merchant's warning.
#
# Points: the key 0 0 (r about 40, levelled at 2 round -4 4); the causeway along x 0 from z 36 to 46; the market's
# foundations x -9..9, z 46..58 (deck about 1 m); tower roofs x -15..-9 and 9..15, z 42.5..51.5 and 52.5..61.5
# (deck 1 m); the back room (a storey) on the north-east roof.
include lib_features
include lib_sea
include lib_rt
include lib_huts
include lib_highwater
include lib_areas
# RESIZE 10-24: Radius 40 -> 85 (Height 5 -> 5), the old content moved 0 24.8 as one frame (push) so its sea side stays at the coast; the island grows behind it.
# DEEP 10-24: Tin Peak: the pedlars climb to ring a bell over the market, the arcade lies drowned under the west shore, and the market's own stall numbers open its strongbox.
# STORY 10-24: no dive on the quest's way any more (the till key is in the pedlars' cave; the sunk arcade is an optional
# secret); the order is a market tour west - south - east - up. Voices: Councillor Crane on the market's speaker, Dobbs's
# complaint No. 230, Marta, Teo Varga, the merchant, the fire warden, Oswin the crier, Rook the pedlar (who holds Pip's
# tin tram, the little six-forty) and 'a friend', whose note names Fleetbreak.
new
gen Trees=0.28 Bushes=0.3 Rocks=0.3 Harvest=0.4 BeachThings=0.25
gen Seed=13201 Radius=85 Height=5 Roughness=0.25 Peaks=1 Shape=0 Style=0 PeakShape=0.3 Cliffs=0.1 BeachWidth=0.6
gen Water=0.5 SeaRocks=0.3 SeaFinds=0.4 Sunken=0.2 Hostiles=0 Friendly=0.3 SeaLife=0.3
generate
push at 0 24.8

